{"_note":"「等你动手的事」—— 待我处理 / 我的 PR / 等我 review 三张卡与 `xJob/reviews.xjob` 共用。**由 tools/infosource/gen_github_todo.py 生成,不要手改**。\n一条 GraphQL(cost 1 点,5000 点/小时),拿回四个 search 桶:rv = 请求你 review 的 PR、ro = 其中最早的那一个(只要创建时间)、my = 你发起的 PR(带 CI 汇总 / review 结论 / 冲突)、as = 指派给你的 issue。\n每行出「数 + 码」不出文案(`N`+`Un` = 多久前,`c` = 状态码),文案在 RCN 词表里按码取 —— `numable run` 不注入取数流的词表,文案放流里会成为验收盲区。\n⚠️ `nRv` 与 `ok` 是 `xJob/reviews.xjob` 的判定输入(`activeCondition` 读 nRv),改名要两边一起改。","version":1,"actions":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"t0","value":"${@time.nowMs}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"hdr","value":{"Accept":"application/json","Content-Type":"application/json","User-Agent":"Numable"}}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"body","value":"{\"query\": \"query{viewer{login avatarUrl} rv:search(query:\\\"is:open is:pr user-review-requested:@me archived:false sort:updated-desc\\\",type:ISSUE,first:5){issueCount nodes{...on PullRequest{title number url createdAt updatedAt additions deletions comments{totalCount} author{login} repository{nameWithOwner}}}} ro:search(query:\\\"is:open is:pr user-review-requested:@me archived:false sort:created-asc\\\",type:ISSUE,first:1){nodes{...on PullRequest{createdAt title number repository{nameWithOwner}}}} my:search(query:\\\"is:open is:pr author:@me archived:false sort:updated-desc\\\",type:ISSUE,first:5){issueCount nodes{...on PullRequest{title number url updatedAt isDraft reviewDecision mergeable additions deletions comments{totalCount} latestOpinionatedReviews(first:2){nodes{state author{login}}} repository{nameWithOwner} statusCheckRollup{state contexts(first:0){totalCount checkRunCountsByState{state count} statusContextCountsByState{state count}}}}}} as:search(query:\\\"is:open is:issue assignee:@me archived:false sort:updated-desc\\\",type:ISSUE,first:5){issueCount nodes{...on Issue{title number url updatedAt repository{nameWithOwner}}}}}\"}"}},{"_note":"GraphQL 出错恒返 200、错误在 errors[] 里;没绑 / 令牌失效时是 401。两种情况下 data.viewer 都取不到 → 下面 ok=0,不会假绿。","id":"q","action":"request","params":{"url":"https://api.github.com/graphql","method":"POST","header":"${hdr}","body":"${body}","formatType":"json","credential":"gh"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"_b","value":"1"},"_note":"⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"login","value":"${q.data.viewer.login}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"ok","value":"$[if::(or::(eq::(connect::(k,${login}),k),eq::(connect::(k,${q.data.rv.issueCount}),k),eq::(connect::(k,${q.data.my.issueCount}),k),eq::(connect::(k,${q.data.as.issueCount}),k)),0,1)]"},"_note":"判据是 **viewer 有没有回来**,不是任何计数:待办恰好全是 0 是好消息,拿计数判会把「今天很干净」误判成「没取到」。⚠️ 用 `connect::(k,…)` 哨兵拼串再比 —— `eq` 是数字化比较,`eq::(0,)` 恒真(todo.df 2026-08-26 栽过)。\n⚠️ 还要求本条流用到的每一段都回来了(need):GraphQL 部分超时会只让某几个 search 为 null、viewer 照常返回 —— 只看 viewer 会把「没取到」渲成「都处理完了」,提醒也会判假而不是未知(2026-09-25 审查实证)。"},{"_note":"取数失败出口:viewer 没回来 = 这一轮什么都不可信(401 / 断网 / GraphQL 整体出错)。抛错让宿主走失败态 —— 不落封面、回落上次成功的数据、提醒判「未知」不响;报成功就会拿一份全空的数据盖掉好数据。⚠️ 「列表为空」是成功,不在这里判。errorMsg 是诊断串,只进运行日志,写英文。","op":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(eq::(${ok},1),0,1)]"},"items":[{"action":"error","params":{"errorMsg":"github graphql: viewer missing (auth or network)"}}]},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"rv_t","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.rv.nodes},title)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"rv_n","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.rv.nodes},number)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"rv_u","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.rv.nodes},url)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"rv_d","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.rv.nodes},updatedAt)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"rv_r","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.rv.nodes},repository.nameWithOwner)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"rv_a","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.rv.nodes},additions)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"rv_dl","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.rv.nodes},deletions)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"rv_cnt","value":"$[length::(${rv_t})]"},"_note":"本次真返回了几条(≤first)。拿标题数组的长度 —— 数组长度判得准。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"nRv","value":"$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${q.data.rv.issueCount},0),0)]"},"_note":"总数(可能大于列出的那几条)。过 parseNumber 出字符串,免得 Android 渲成 3.0。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"my_t","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.my.nodes},title)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"my_n","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.my.nodes},number)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"my_u","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.my.nodes},url)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"my_d","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.my.nodes},updatedAt)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"my_r","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.my.nodes},repository.nameWithOwner)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"my_st","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.my.nodes},statusCheckRollup.state)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"my_rd","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.my.nodes},reviewDecision)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"my_mg","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.my.nodes},mergeable)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"my_dr","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.my.nodes},isDraft)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"my_a","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.my.nodes},additions)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"my_dl","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.my.nodes},deletions)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"my_cnt","value":"$[length::(${my_t})]"},"_note":"本次真返回了几条(≤first)。拿标题数组的长度 —— 数组长度判得准。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"nMy","value":"$[parseNumber::(findNotEmpty::(${q.data.my.issueCount},0),0)]"},"_note":"总数(可能大于列出的那几条)。过 parseNumber 出字符串,免得 Android 渲成 3.0。"},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"as_t","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.as.nodes},title)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"as_n","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.as.nodes},number)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"as_u","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.as.nodes},url)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"as_d","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.as.nodes},updatedAt)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"as_r","value":"$[pluck::(${q.data.as.nodes},repository.nameWithOwner)]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"as_cnt","value":"$[length::(${as_t})]"},"_note":"本次真返回了几条(≤first)。拿标题数组的长度 —— 数组长度判得准。"},{"op":"set","props"